            "text": "Election results still the story; October gun sales up 7.9%; Sixth Circuit upholds mental-health gun ban",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "Massachusetts keeps its 2024 gun law, Arkansas approved its right-to-bear-arms amendment, and Democrats are projected to lead both chambers (unofficial until certified). October adjusted gun-sales checks ran 7.9% above last year, and Ruger reported Q3 sales up 16.5%.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
